&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="32-deploy-version-mới"&gt;3.2. Deploy version mới
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;pre class="mermaid"&gt;
sequenceDiagram
participant Dev as Developer
participant Git as Git Repo
participant DEV as ArgoCD DEV
participant Approver as Approver
participant Main as Branch Main
participant Prod as ArgoCD PROD
Dev-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Git: merge feature → develop
Git-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;DEV: auto sync
DEV--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Dev: verify OK
Dev-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Approver: tạo PR develop → main
Approver-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Main: approve + merge
Dev-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Git: git tag v2.1.0
Dev-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Git: cập nhật ApplicationSet (revision → v2.1.0)
Approver-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Git: review + approve thay đổi ApplicationSet
Git-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Prod: ArgoCD detect revision mới → sync
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thao tác cụ thể:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# 1. PR develop → main đã được approve và merge&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# 2. Đánh tag&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git checkout main
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git tag v2.1.0
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git push origin --tags
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# 3. Sửa ApplicationSet — chỉ env cần lên&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# staging: v2.0.0 → v2.1.0&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# prod: v2.0.0 → v2.1.0&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# customer-a: giữ nguyên v2.0.0&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
